# Inline emphasis

A paragraph with /italic/ and *bold* and /*bold italic*/ words.

Inline `code spans` get monospaced.

Smart quotes: "double" and 'single'. Em-dash --- and en-dash --.

Math: $\pi r^2$ inline; display below.

$$E = mc^2$$

Insert {+new text+}, delete {-old text-}, highlight =emphasized=.

Subscript H{,2,}O and superscript E=mc{^2^}.

A symbol :rocket: and an inline extension :kbd[Ctrl].

Backslash escape \*literal asterisks\* and \/literal slashes\/ in prose.
